type: software
title: "The hypercube Ramsey number has linear order in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the theorem that the diagonal Ramsey number of the
  n-dimensional hypercube is at most C times 2^n for an absolute constant C > 0.
